ul actions can deepen relationships, build trust, and inspire long-term generosity in your community. This session will highlight practical stewardship ideas that fit naturally into what you\u2019re already doing, while reinforcing NCF\u2019s shared commitment to caring well for the people who care about our places.","url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1227520751","upload_date":"2026-09-16 17:42:27","thumbnail_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2201758268-e1e4e2ea7fe123ad13d272a8ed1781761e74371ae879bcb9941452146e4489d4-d_100x75?region=us","thumbnail_medium":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2201758268-e1e4e2ea7fe123ad13d272a8ed1781761e74371ae879bcb9941452146e4489d4-d_200x150?region=us","thumbnail_large":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2201758268-e1e4e2ea7fe123ad13d272a8ed1781761e74371ae879bcb9941452146e4489d4-d_640?region=us","user_id":4620608,"user_name":"Nebraska Community Foundation","user_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/ncf","user_portrait_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_30x30?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_medium":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_75x75?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_large":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_100x100?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_huge":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_300x300?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","stats_number_of_likes":0,"stats_number_of_plays":7,"stats_number_of_comments":0,"duration":2262,"width":2560,"height":1440,"tags":"","embed_privacy":"anywhere"},{"id":1218103109,"title":"Nebraska City Community Foundation Fund","description":"","url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1218103109","upload_date":"2026-08-13 15:26:57","thumbnail_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2189942063-d8f3d2f9d1ce63fc2cb0d3be6e77dd64f82cd5c5b