king to reignite progress, this session will show you what NCF Development Programs can do to help you move your work forward with purpose and clarity.","url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1210286812","upload_date":"2026-07-15 14:43:27","thumbnail_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2180132813-4f4a25a8f782bdfd2aa10172ba93b1dc11ecab6388b1074dd7900a8a9530e8b1-d_100x75?region=us","thumbnail_medium":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2180132813-4f4a25a8f782bdfd2aa10172ba93b1dc11ecab6388b1074dd7900a8a9530e8b1-d_200x150?region=us","thumbnail_large":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2180132813-4f4a25a8f782bdfd2aa10172ba93b1dc11ecab6388b1074dd7900a8a9530e8b1-d_640?region=us","user_id":4620608,"user_name":"Nebraska Community Foundation","user_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/ncf","user_portrait_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_30x30?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_medium":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_75x75?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_large":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_100x100?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_huge":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_300x300?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","stats_number_of_likes":0,"stats_number_of_plays":19,"stats_number_of_comments":0,"duration":3164,"width":2560,"height":1600,"tags":"","embed_privacy":"anywhere"},{"id":1207494849,"title":"Clarkson Future Fund","description":"","url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1207494849","upload_date":"2026-07-06 14:55:34","thumbnail_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2176604566-9dca5eca80fb417ecb0b7a47f2cbd9b97bec77a4c0c9b1f0973707baec584ccc-d_100x75?region=us","thumbnail_medium":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2176604566-9dca5eca80fb417ecb0b7a47f2cbd9b97bec77a4c0c9b1f0973707baec584ccc-d_200x150?region=us","thumbnail_large":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/video\/2176604566-9dca5eca80fb417ecb0b7a47f2cbd9b97bec77a4c0c9b1f0973707baec584ccc-d_640?region=us","user_id":4620608,"user_name":"Nebraska Community Foundation","user_url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/ncf","user_portrait_small":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_30x30?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_medium":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_75x75?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_large":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_100x100?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","user_portrait_huge":"https:\/\/i.vimeocdn.com\/portrait\/12668414_300x300?sig=ef5bd787e8b57ba9cc625f69d6a6dcbc4479c9b71b6d0ee20a34d1035be28fa6&v=1&region=us","stats_number_of_likes":0,"stats_number_of_plays":24,"stats_number_of_comments":0,"duration":293,"width":1920,"height":1080,"tags":"","embed_privacy":"anywhere"},{"id":1203605363,"title":"Lunch & Learn: Joyful - Putting the \u201cFun\u201d in Affiliated Fund Development!","description":"What if joy isn\u2019t separate from community development, but one of the most powerful assets we already have?<br \/>\n<br \/>\nAt the heart of asset-based community development is a simple idea: people are more likely to invest in their communities when they feel connected to one another, hopeful about the future, and invited to belong. Joy might just be the secret sauce that helps make that possible.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis Lunch & Learn will explore how affiliated funds can spark momentum by leaning into the abundance already present in their communities: relationships, traditions, creativity, generosity, hospitality, local stories, gathering spaces, music, food, youth, celebration, and the simple goodness that happens when people genuinely enjoy being together.","url":"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1203605363","upl